WEBVTT

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:03.830
So we meet again.

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:07.630
What is this place?
What are you doing here?

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:12.830
That is none of your concern.
You're coming with me, Aria.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:15.460
I'm not Aria.

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:18.040
Aria is... my mother.

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:23.790
That should not be possible...

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:26.500
Even if she did have a child, it matters not.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.210
What do you know?

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:31.170
Enough chit-chat.

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:31.750
Fight me!

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:38.210
You... Have you raised your Status?

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.460
I won't be defeated by you.

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:43.710
I won't even need my wind.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.130
Don't get cocky!

00:01:06.710 --> 00:01:11.170
Tarinai mono sagashi utsumuitara

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:14.880
Konna suteki na basho ni deaenai

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:21.130
Aimai na monosashi wa mou shimaou

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:26.170
Yuuki ga ichimen hirogaru kara

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:31.710
Hitomi ni wa uso no nai ima ga utsutte

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:35.920
Iranai tsuyogari o sutete

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:40.540
Issho ni naki egao ni narou

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:46.630
Hajiite sorezore no speed de suki na you ni kazatta

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:51.580
Kimi ga ireba kiseki mo okiru RE-ILLUSION

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:54.250
Terashiai kagayaite

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:59.000
Sono saki de yume to yume mazariatte

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:01.210
Soujou kouka o unde

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:08.920
Shoushin shoumei no katai kizuna de sekai watatta

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:21.830
What do you mean?! Fil-

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:25.710
How could Miss Filvis be cursed?

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:31.710
Bein' an Adventurer, you musta heard o'
the Nightmare on Level 27.

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:35.330
Yes, I've heard the tale.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:41.290
Adventurers, led into a trap by the dark faction, Evilus,
slaughtered by the dozens...

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:42.170
That's it.

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:46.000
Those Evilus bastards pranced around,

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.880
spoke o' "seekin' the chaos" and
"startin' a revolution."

00:02:49.330 --> 00:02:53.630
But the fact was they were just a bunch o' greedy,
deranged lunatics who did whatever they pleased.

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:58.880
Once they had their fill, their leader, Vendetta,
who the Guild had finally tracked down,

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:04.040
lured a bunch o' adventurers to Level 27
and instigated a huge Pass Parade.

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:07.880
Wanted to drag anyone an' everyone with him to Hell.

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:12.500
No allies, no enemies- just a bloody battle royal
even the Floor Boss couldn't avoid.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:15.040
Evilus were annihilated, o' course,

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:17.630
but a damn obscene number o'
Adventurers were lost too.

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:22.880
Accordin' to the guys who showed up afterwards,
the whole place looked like a scene straight outta Hell.

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:25.960
Pools o' blood far as the eye could see.

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:30.460
Your girl Filvis Challia survived that day.

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:36.750
By the time she made it back here,
she looked nearly dead herself.

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:42.670
After that, whenever she'd reform her Party,
they'd get completely wiped out.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:44.250
Happened four times.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:47.080
Every time, she was the only survivor.

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:52.710
Folks started callin' her the Cursed Adventurer.
Banshee, the Elf who heralds Death.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:56.000
She's been adventurin' solo
for a while now, though.

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:58.540
Never thought I'd see her with the likes o' you.

00:03:58.540 --> 00:03:59.580
B-but!

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:05.080
The Nightmare on Level 27, the deaths of her
Party members- those are all just terrible coincidences!

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:05.460
Why-

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:05.790
That may be the case.
Why-

00:04:05.790 --> 00:04:06.830
That may be the case.

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:11.330
But Adventurers are constantly fightin'
by the skins o' their teeth.

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:15.290
Who would choose to fight with somebody
as steeped in bad luck as her?

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:20.580
Take my advice. Stay away from her.

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:30.130
Why wallow in your own misfortune now?

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.540
So you know about my past, then.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:43.420
Well, you adventure long enough and you're bound
to hear the name "Banshee" come up once or twice.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:45.880
And the shitty story that goes with it.

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:50.330
Time after time, desertin' your allies
so you can survive alone without shame.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:54.040
What're you still adventurin' for, huh?
Just die already.

00:04:58.250 --> 00:04:59.960
You're right.

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:04.170
Lord Dionysus may have sent me along with you,
but I've caused you trouble.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.670
We should split up from this point onward.

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:10.920
Hmph! You far-sighted idiots piss me off the most!

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:22.130
Miss Filvis!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.250
There you are!

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:28.670
It looks like Miss Ais headed to
the Pantry on Level 24.

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:29.630
We should hurry and-

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:30.460
Enough!

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:32.080
Leave me alone.

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:35.000
You heard all about me, didn't you?

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:37.670
I did...

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:38.210
Then-

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:41.750
But I... I want to continue on by your side, Miss Filvis!

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:46.630
Did you not understand what they said about me?!

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:49.290
I understood! But we're a Party!

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:50.460
We're not a Party!

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:51.330
Yes, we are!

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:52.790
I never wanted to team up with you!

00:05:52.790 --> 00:05:53.750
We ARE a team!

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:59.290
There are things you learn
after spending time with someone.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.580
I know you're not the type of person
who would abandon your comrades.

00:06:02.630 --> 00:06:04.880
The reason you keep saying
that we're not a Party

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:09.960
is because you're afraid we might fall to that
same curse everyone talks about. Am I wrong?

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:20.580
I'm lucky enough to have some amazing comrades.
I look up to every one of them.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:24.000
If we ever face something terrible
during an adventure,

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:29.250
I'll do anything I can to save the people
most important to me, without any regret.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:32.540
I'm sure your comrades felt the same!

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:34.750
They wanted you to survive on and-

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:35.500
You're wrong!

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.080
I killed my comrades!

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:42.380
I lingered on because I couldn't save my friends!

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:44.080
I'm tainted!

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:45.330
You're not tainted!

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:49.540
You're a kind and beautiful person,
no matter what anyone says!

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:51.130
More than I could ever be!

00:06:53.380 --> 00:06:57.880
How can you say that?
You just met me for the first time today.

00:06:58.420 --> 00:07:01.250
I... I know that...

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:04.500
Then starting now, I'll find all your best qualities!

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:16.920
Miss Filvis?

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:21.000
You're an odd one, aren't you, Viridis?

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:25.960
Miss Filvis...

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:31.920
However, it would be best if we went our separate ways.

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:33.710
I told the Werewolf the same.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:36.580
If it's Bete you're worried about, I can convince him!

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:37.920
Or at least try...

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:39.210
Hey!

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:42.170
Hurry it up, ya stupid Elves!

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:44.330
You... came back?

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.420
Idiot.

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:49.920
You think I'm gonna suddenly kick the bucket
because o' some dumb curse or whatever?

00:07:51.670 --> 00:07:53.830
Don't lump me together with the small fry.

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:57.670
I ain't gonna die, whether you're there or not.

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:03.080
You just make sure
you don't slow me down, Miss Banshee.

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:05.460
That's how he always is.

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:17.580
You ranked up.

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:22.630
Damn god's blessing... I've had it!
This is why I can't stand Adventurers!

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:28.920
What is that?

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:35.580
Is it... draining the nutrients from that pillar?

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:38.670
That orb! It's just like the other one!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:41.920
Then that's...

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:46.330
Asfi, what do we do now?

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:49.330
We were asked to investigate the current situation.

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:54.830
Though we've lost sight of the Sword Princess, we
still need to go back and report what we've found. But-

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:56.540
I knew you would come.

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:57.250
Who's there?

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:01.330
That's why I told her not to let
that monster horde run amok.

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:04.080
It's only caused us more trouble...

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:09.210
There's still more of these things?!

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:10.500
Hold your positions!

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:19.170
He must be another Tamer...

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:22.920
As long as he's still around,
we'll have no chance of escaping.

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:25.040
Falgar, take care of the plants!

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:36.960
You're quick, Perseus. However...

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:39.460
Talaria!

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:43.000
What?

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:44.920
I will take you down!

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:00.960
Too slow.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:10.170
Asfi!

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:21.580
Not to worry. I'm keenly aware of
how stubborn you Adventurers can be...

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:25.880
I'll make sure you're dead as a doornail.

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:32.920
Fusillade Fallarica!

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:43.960
Reinforcements, huh?

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:48.420
Is that you, Lefiya?!

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:51.750
Lulune, what are you doing here?! What's going on?

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.170
We aren't really sure yet...

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:56.210
Hey! Where's Ais?!

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:58.130
The Sword Princess got separated from us!

00:10:58.130 --> 00:10:59.830
This is getting irritating.

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:06.500
His wounds!

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:09.080
I'll finish you all at once.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:09.830
Viscum!

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:16.790
You won't leave here alive!

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:19.250
Prepare yourselves for the afterlife...

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:22.630
Who are you?

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:24.750
What are you trying to accomplish here?!

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.210
This place is a Plant.

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:28.460
A "Plant"?

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:34.540
Yes. A Pantry for the Viscum to feed off of
and produce Violas.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:39.210
You mean those monsters
all came from that big bastard?

00:11:39.830 --> 00:11:43.330
I've never even heard of monsters
giving birth to other monsters!

00:11:43.630 --> 00:11:46.080
But why would you do such a thing?

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:47.920
For one purpose!

00:11:47.920 --> 00:11:50.710
To drive the Violas from the deep levels
up to the surface and

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:53.330
destroy the City of Orario!

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:54.960
Destroy it?!

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:58.420
Yes! Demolish it, as is my Lady's wish!

00:11:58.420 --> 00:12:05.880
The Violas and I will do whatever She asks of us!
For She has blessed me with eternity!

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:11.670
Olivas Act...

00:12:13.380 --> 00:12:16.040
Olivas? You mean...

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:18.540
That's Vendetta?!

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:22.170
How is he alive...?

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:27.040
Olivas Act of Evilus died in the Nightmare on Level 27!

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:38.630
How is he alive...?

00:12:38.920 --> 00:12:43.880
Olivas Act of Evilus died in the Nightmare on Level 27!

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:48.500
How could that be?

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:59.290
You're right, I did die.
But She gave me life once more!

00:13:05.580 --> 00:13:07.040
A M-Magic Stone!

00:13:07.040 --> 00:13:11.500
Are you saying you're some kind of monster hybrid?!

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:17.790
Indeed. I've been blessed with a second chance
by none other than the Lady Herself!

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:22.380
I can hear Her voice!

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:25.580
"I want to see the sky," she says! "I want to claim the sky!"

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:30.170
The city blocks Her from seeing the sky
as She sleeps deep beneath the earth!

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:31.710
It must be cleared away!

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:39.000
She should be the one to rule over this land,
not foolish men and foolish gods!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:45.960
Laughing as they're entertained, no respect for life!
She is not like your idle, slothful gods!

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:49.750
She has shown me grace!

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:52.960
I am the chosen one! Chosen by Her!

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:58.630
Only I can carry out Her wishes!
Only I can fulfill her desires!

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:01.580
To destroy this city! To destroy Orario!

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:04.040
SHE IS MY EVERYTHING!

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:06.750
He's deranged...

00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:07.920
Olivas Act!

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:15.380
After the horrors you've committed, how dare you...!

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:19.080
Ah, so you survived that day as well.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:20.080
How dare you!

00:14:20.080 --> 00:14:22.380
Sweep them away! Sacred staff of thunder.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.670
Dio Thyrsos!

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:31.710
Miss Filvis!

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.000
The show is over.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:35.580
Viscum! Violas!

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:41.380
Everyone, attack!

00:14:44.920 --> 00:14:46.210
Take care of these plants!

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:47.630
Are you all right?

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:49.500
Fine. But...

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:53.170
At this rate...

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:56.580
Miss Filvis! Watch my back!

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:57.630
What?

00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:03.000
Miss Filvis, you're not cursed! I believe in you!

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:05.210
Viridis...

00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:13.040
Proud warriors. Archers of the forest.

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:15.960
Take up your bows at the encroaching ravagers.

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:19.790
Answer the call of your brethren, and nock your arrows!

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:21.670
Crap!

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.670
Tinge them with flames, lights of the forest.

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:27.380
Release your elven arrows of fire!

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:31.830
Be thee my shield! Holy grail of light! Dio Grail!

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:41.960
Make them fall like rain and turn the savages to ash!

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:43.630
Finish them!

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.580
Fusillade Fallarica!

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:06.500
You're next, Pal.

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:08.580
Ready to die for good this time?

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:13.670
Did you think this was over?!

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:24.750
I told you. None of you will leave here alive!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.080
I will do it for my Lady!

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.080
To fulfill Her desires!

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:33.670
Miss Ais!

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:43.710
Incredible... She isn't even using her magic...!

00:16:47.130 --> 00:16:49.380
What a disgrace, Revis.

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:54.000
So that girl is Aria, huh?

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:55.460
Aria?

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:59.500
Take her away, Viscum!
Bring back her corpse if you must!

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:00.460
Stop!

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:05.710
If you can't get the job done, I'll do it myself.
You should be grateful.

00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:08.540
Tempest!

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:21.920
Impossible! My Viscum...!

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:23.880
Whoa...

00:17:23.880 --> 00:17:25.210
Go to Hell, ya fiend!

00:17:25.420 --> 00:17:27.000
Don't get cocky, Werewolf!

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:33.210
Unleash a streak of light, bow and arrow of the holy tree.

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:34.960
Thou art a master of the bow.

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:37.130
Fire, O elven archer.

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:40.500
May your arrow strike true!

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.080
Arcs Ray!

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:47.460
It's useless.

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:56.290
Vanargand!

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:07.000
Die!

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:18.750
Not... not... possible...

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:23.210
She gave me... Her blessing...

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:24.790
What a farce.

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:30.170
Revis...

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:32.290
We must withdraw.

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:36.540
I must survive... to complete Her task-

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:46.670
Wh-why...

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:49.790
I discovered a need for more power.

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:51.790
You can't...

00:18:51.790 --> 00:19:00.130
You and I both... Her... chosen ones.

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:02.210
Don't be ridiculous.

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:05.960
Does she honestly look like a goddess to you?

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:34.250
Aria... Even this does not give me the strength...
to match you in battle.

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:37.830
What was that?!

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:38.790
The pillar!

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:48.710
This won't hold for much longer! Run!

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:54.130
Aria, go to Level 59.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:57.210
There, you should find the answer to what you seek.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.420
Level 59?

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:01.630
Tell us what we'll find there!

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:04.580
I'm sure you have an inkling already.

00:20:09.670 --> 00:20:11.710
Ais! This place is collapsing!

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:13.170
Let's go, Miss Ais!

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:21.380
I think I'll take some time to gather my strength.
The next time we meet, I'll surpass you.

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:23.580
You can look forward to that, Aria.

00:20:38.290 --> 00:20:41.830
That's the gist of what I heard from Ais, Bete, and Lefiya

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:44.000
about this last incident.

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:46.040
I see...

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:48.540
I never expected to see Vendetta again...

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:50.750
The nightmare still lingers on after all this time.

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:52.500
Our enemies are hybrids.

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:54.830
And like the seeds that enhance monsters' strength,

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:58.380
they can gain power by consuming
the Magic Stones of their comrades.

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:00.210
Nasty creatures, indeed.

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:04.330
They told her to go to Level 59, huh...?

00:21:04.580 --> 00:21:05.880
What did Ais have to say?

00:21:05.880 --> 00:21:09.830
She wants to go. Though that doesn't surprise me.

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:13.040
Well, we've already been preparin'
for the expedition, after all.

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:15.960
In a way, this kinda helped us
make up our minds, right?

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:17.670
True.

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:23.380
Having an extra end goal or two isn't a bad thing.
Let's launch the expedition.

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:28.580
Ohayou mado o akete

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:32.040
Doko e datte ikerunda

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:35.920
Kibou wa itsumo sasayaita

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:39.920
Doko made mo aruitekou

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:46.670
Narabete kurabete tameiki tsuite

00:21:46.670 --> 00:21:53.040
Wakatteru wakatteru

00:21:54.540 --> 00:22:01.580
Yasashisa to ka nukumori to ka

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:05.290
Kimi datte ano ko datte

00:22:05.420 --> 00:22:12.000
Itsuka kitto ai o shirunda

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:19.080
Asu no kimi ga kyou no kimi o

00:22:19.330 --> 00:22:22.670
Omoide ni kaete

00:22:22.670 --> 00:22:26.880
Oikoshite susundeku

00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:33.960
Ame ga yande kao o agete

00:22:33.960 --> 00:22:39.880
"Arigatou" tte sunao ni waraeru hazu sa

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:43.330
Hello hello hello

00:22:43.540 --> 00:22:52.130
Dareka no tame ai o utaou

00:22:55.130 --> 00:22:56.380
Hmm...

00:22:56.380 --> 00:22:59.750
Are you sure there are books in here
about someone called Aria?

00:22:59.750 --> 00:23:02.130
Yep! One hundred percent.

00:23:02.130 --> 00:23:05.170
Ah! Here it is! Tada!

00:23:05.880 --> 00:23:07.920
The Spirit, Aria.

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:09.710
"Spirit"...?

00:23:09.710 --> 00:23:10.420
I loved reading heroic tales since I was a kid,

00:23:10.420 --> 00:23:13.670
Spirit... The race most beloved of the gods.
I loved reading heroic tales since I was a kid,

00:23:13.670 --> 00:23:14.460
Spirit... The race most beloved of the gods.
and I remembered this one!

00:23:14.460 --> 00:23:14.830
and I remembered this one!

00:23:14.830 --> 00:23:16.210
I was wondering what you meant
when you said you knew something about her.

00:23:16.210 --> 00:23:18.330
Masters of magic and miracles...
I was wondering what you meant
when you said you knew something about her.

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:20.080
Then lo and behold- fairy tales!

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:30.040
Couldn't be her.

00:23:32.290 --> 00:23:35.250
"Dungeon Oratoria", huh...?

00:23:37.880 --> 00:23:39.830
"Training and Jealousy"
